  "body": "Situated on the doorstep of Browns Bay, close to good schools, transport, the beautiful beach and the many cafes and restaurants, this 4-bedroom family home has been owned by our seller since new in 1998. It has been a much-loved home where many memories have been made. However, the time is now right for our seller to let someone else buy this home so that they too can create their special memories.\r\n\r\nComprising 2 levels, this home provides ample space with a generous floor area for a growing family or those seeking a Bays' lifestyle. The car enthusiast will love the size of the double garage, or it could be ideal for a home gym or games room.\r\nThe spacious open plan kitchen, dining and lounge is the hub of this home which connects to the modern conservatory flowing out to a deck and garden - perfect for entertaining family and friends while the children play in the back garden. Upstairs you can enjoy taking in the wonderful sea and urban views.\r\n\r\nOur sellers' instructions are clear - this home must be sold on or before Auction Day. \r\n\r\nCall us now for a private viewing or we will see you at the open homes! \r\n\r\nDon't Delay - Act today to secure this Rangi Zone Winner!!\r\n\r\nDownload property documents at https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/15JM",
